+- Any rejection inside the turn calls `onError` with an `Error` — passed through when the thrown value is already an `Error`, or wrapped with a readable `message` and the original value as `cause` when a string, object, or `undefined` is thrown — and then runs `afterSession` while still propagating the rejection to the caller ([validated by: calls onError with an Error carrying the thrown string and runs afterSession while rethrowing](../../src/orchestration/onErrorNonError.acceptance.test.ts#L53), [validated by: calls onError with an Error carrying a readable message when the stream rejects with a plain object](../../src/orchestration/onErrorNonError.acceptance.test.ts#L64), [validated by: wraps a thrown string, plain object, or undefined in an Error with cause while rethrowing the original](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.test.ts#L335)).

